      "worked": "Since $x$ varies directly with $y$, $x=ky$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}4&=6k\\\\k&=\\frac{2}{3}\\\\x&=\\frac{2}{3}y\\\\y&=\\frac{3}{2}x\\end{align*}$$\n\nWhen $x=8$:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}y&=\\frac{3}{2}\\times8\\\\y&=12\\end{align*}$$\n\nWhen $x=12$:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}y&=\\frac{3}{2}\\times12\\\\y&=18\\end{align*}$$\n\nWhen $x=16$:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}y&=\\frac{3}{2}\\times16\\\\y&=24\\end{align*}$$",
